<mxfile host="drawio" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="03-lista-de-espera-e-encaixe" name="03-lista-de-espera-e-encaixe"><mxGraphModel dx="800" dy="600" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam componentStyle rectangle\nskinparam component {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF\n    BorderColor #2C3E50\n    ArrowColor #2C3E50\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Agendador\&quot; as Cron #7F8C8D\nactor \&quot;Cliente\&quot; as User #0B4A6A\n\ncomponent \&quot;WebFrontend\&quot; as Tela #BE2C2E\ncomponent \&quot;ListaEsperaAppService\&quot; as Control #87A446\ncomponent \&quot;MySQLRepository\&quot; as Repo #E76F26\ncomponent \&quot;Lista de Espera\&quot; as Fila #5B9BD5\ncomponent \&quot;Disponibilidade\&quot; as Disp #5B9BD5\ncomponent \&quot;Oferta de Encaixe\&quot; as Oferta #5B9BD5\ncomponent \&quot;Agendamento\&quot; as Agend #5B9BD5\ncomponent \&quot;ComunicacaoAppService\&quot; as Com #5B9BD5\ncomponent \&quot;Notificação\&quot; as Notif #5B9BD5\ncomponent \&quot;NotificationServiceAdapter\&quot; as NotifAdapter #F4B324\n\nCron -down-&gt; Control : 1. processarFilaEspera()\\n3. [expira] verificarOfertas()\nUser -right-&gt; Tela : 2. aceitarOferta() / recusarOferta()\nTela -right-&gt; Control : 2.1. processarAceite() / processarRecusa()\n\nControl -down-&gt; Repo : 1.1. buscar()\\n1.1.4. salvar(Oferta)\\n2.1.2. [aceite] buscar()\\n2.1.5. salvar(Oferta)\\n2.1.7. [livre] salvar(Agendamento)\\n3.2. [expira] salvar(Oferta)\n\nControl -right-&gt; Fila : 1.1.2. candidatosPara()\nControl -down-&gt; Disp : 2.1.3. [aceite] contém()\nControl -right-&gt; Oferta : 1.1.3. &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt;\\n2.1.1. [aceite] éVálida()\\n2.1.4. [livre] aceitar() / [ocupado] expirar() / [recusa] recusar()\\n3.1. [expira] expirar()\nControl -down-&gt; Agend : 2.1.6. [livre] &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt;\n\nControl -up-&gt; Com : 1.2. notificar()\nCom -down-&gt; Notif : 1.2.1. &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt;\\n1.2.3. registrarSituaçãoEnvio()\nCom -right-&gt; NotifAdapter : 1.2.2. enviar(Notificação)\n\n@enduml&quot;, &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;}" id="uml"><mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1757" height="451" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>